      "body": "\n### 🖥️ 桌面端\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>首页</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>渠道</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>分组</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bestruirui/octopus/refs/heads/dev/web/public/screenshot/desktop-home.png\" alt=\"首页\" width=\"400\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bestruirui/octopus/refs/heads/dev/web/public/screenshot/desktop-channel.png\" alt=\"渠道\" width=\"400\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bestruirui/octopus/refs/heads/dev/web/public/screenshot/desktop-group.png\" alt=\"分组\" width=\"400\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>价格</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>日志</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>设置</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bestruirui/octopus/refs/heads/dev/web/public/screenshot/desktop-price.png\" alt=\"价格\" width=\"400\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bestruirui/octopus/refs/heads/dev/web/public/screenshot/desktop-log.png\" alt=\"日志\" width=\"400\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bestruirui/octopus/refs/heads/dev/web/public/screenshot/desktop-setting.png\" alt=\"设置\" width=\"400\"></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n### 📱 移动端\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>首页</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>渠道</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>分组</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>价格</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>日志</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>设置</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bestruirui/octopus/refs/heads/dev/web/public/screenshot/mobile-home.png\" alt=\"移动端首页\" width=\"140\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bestruirui/octopus/refs/heads/dev/web/public/screenshot/mobile-channel.png\" alt=\"移动端渠道\" width=\"140\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bestruirui/octopus/refs/heads/dev/web/public/screenshot/mobile-group.png\" alt=\"移动端分组\" width=\"140\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bestruirui/octopus/refs/heads/dev/web/public/screenshot/mobile-price.png\" alt=\"移动端价格\" width=\"140\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bestruirui/octopus/refs/heads/dev/web/public/screenshot/mobile-log.png\" alt=\"移动端日志\" width=\"140\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bestruirui/octopus/refs/heads/dev/web/public/screenshot/mobile-setting.png\" alt=\"移动端设置\" width=\"140\"></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n## ✨ 特性\n\n- ⭐ **分组管理**  - 分组名称即请求模型名称，无需重启客户端即可更换渠道和模型\n- 🔀 **多渠道聚合** - 支持接入多个 LLM 供应商渠道，支持 OpenAI Chat / OpenAI Responses / Anthropic / Gemini\n- ⚖️ **负载均衡** - 四种负载均衡模式，更好的确保流畅稳定的编码体验\n- 🔄 **协议互转** - 支持 OpenAI Chat / OpenAI Responses / Anthropic 三种 API 格式互相转换\n- 💰 **价格同步** - 自动更新模型价格\n- 🔃 **模型同步** - 自动与渠道同步可用模型列表\n- 📊 **数据统计** - 全面的请求统计、Token 消耗、费用追踪\n- 🎨 **优雅界面** - 简洁美观的 Web 管理面板\n\n## 开源地址\n\nhttps://github.com/bestruirui/octopus",
